# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT - credentials and personal data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# tw_logon holds account password hashes. tw_char holds characters. scripts/backup-db.ps1
# writes here on purpose; this rule is what keeps those dumps off GitHub.
backup/
*.dump.sql
*char*.sql
*logon*.sql
transfer-dumps/

# A real deployment's config, if you ever change the credentials in server/conf.
# The committed .conf files use localhost mangos/mangos defaults and no personal data.
server/conf/*.local.conf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game data extracted from the client - 3.75 GB, and not ours to redistribute.
# Regenerate with the extractors in server/bin (see README).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
maps/
vmaps/
mmaps/
dbc/
*.mpq
*.MPQ

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output and noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
out/
logs/
*.pdb
*.log
mangosd.exe.*
*.bak-*
*.before-*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pid

# The WoW icon pack (8,628 PNGs) lives OUTSIDE this repo, at D:/Games/turtlewow/wowiconpack.
# It is reference art for picking custom icons - the PNG -> BLP2 path in content/build.py -
# not a dependency, and nothing here references it. At 8,636 files it was 99% of the repo's
# file count for 0% of its content, which made git status and clones slow. These rules stop
# it coming back if it is ever copied in again.
wowiconpack/
wowiconpack.zip
